@startuml CiviCore_Sequence_Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #1976D2
    LifeLineBorderColor #1976D2
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ParticipantBorderColor #1976D2
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
}

title CiviCore - Application Submission and Approval Sequence

actor "Citizen" as Citizen
participant "Flutter App" as App
participant "AuthService" as Auth
participant "ApplicationService" as AppService
participant "API Client" as API
participant "Backend API" as Backend
participant "AuthController" as AuthCtrl
participant "ApplicationController" as AppCtrl
participant "Database" as DB

== User Login ==
Citizen -> App: Enter credentials
App -> Auth: login(email, password)
Auth -> API: POST /api/auth/login
API -> Backend: HTTP Request
Backend -> AuthCtrl: login()
AuthCtrl -> DB: SELECT user WHERE email
DB --> AuthCtrl: User data
AuthCtrl -> DB: Verify password (bcrypt)
AuthCtrl -> AuthCtrl: Generate JWT token
AuthCtrl -> DB: INSERT audit_log
AuthCtrl --> Backend: {success, token, user}
Backend --> API: JSON Response
API --> Auth: Response data
Auth -> App: Store token locally
Auth --> App: UserModel
App --> Citizen: Show dashboard

== Application Submission ==
Citizen -> App: Select service and apply
App -> AppService: createApplication(serviceId)
AppService -> API: POST /api/applications\nAuthorization: Bearer token
API -> Backend: HTTP Request with JWT
Backend -> Backend: Validate JWT token
Backend -> AppCtrl: createApplication()
AppCtrl -> DB: Generate application_number
AppCtrl -> DB: INSERT application\n(status='pending')
DB --> AppCtrl: application_id
AppCtrl -> DB: INSERT application_log
AppCtrl -> DB: INSERT audit_log
AppCtrl --> Backend: {success, application_id}
Backend --> API: JSON Response
API --> AppService: Response data
AppService --> App: ApplicationModel
App --> Citizen: Show success message

== Document Upload ==
Citizen -> App: Upload document
App -> AppService: uploadDocument(applicationId, file)
AppService -> API: POST /api/documents/upload\nFormData
API -> Backend: Multipart request
Backend -> Backend: Validate file type/size
Backend -> Backend: Save file to uploads/
Backend -> DB: INSERT application_document
DB --> Backend: document_id
Backend --> API: {success, document_id}
API --> AppService: Response
AppService --> App: Success
App --> Citizen: Document uploaded

== Officer Review ==
participant "Officer" as Officer
participant "Officer App" as OfficerApp

Officer -> OfficerApp: Login
OfficerApp -> OfficerApp: View assigned applications
OfficerApp -> API: GET /api/applications/assigned
API -> Backend: Request with JWT
Backend -> AppCtrl: getAssignedApplications()
AppCtrl -> DB: SELECT applications\nWHERE officer_id = ?
DB --> AppCtrl: Applications list
AppCtrl --> Backend: JSON data
Backend --> API: Response
API --> OfficerApp: Applications
OfficerApp --> Officer: Display list

Officer -> OfficerApp: Select application
OfficerApp -> API: GET /api/applications/{id}
API -> Backend: Request
Backend -> AppCtrl: getApplication(id)
AppCtrl -> DB: SELECT application + documents + logs
DB --> AppCtrl: Full application data
AppCtrl --> Backend: JSON
Backend --> API: Response
API --> OfficerApp: ApplicationModel
OfficerApp --> Officer: Show details

== Application Approval ==
Officer -> OfficerApp: Approve application
OfficerApp -> API: POST /api/applications/{id}/approve\n{remarks: "..."}
API -> Backend: Request
Backend -> AppCtrl: approveApplication(id)
AppCtrl -> DB: UPDATE application\nSET status='approved',\napproved_date=NOW()
AppCtrl -> AppCtrl: Generate certificate_path
AppCtrl -> DB: INSERT application_log
AppCtrl -> DB: INSERT audit_log
AppCtrl --> Backend: {success, certificate_path}
Backend --> API: Response
API --> OfficerApp: Success
OfficerApp --> Officer: Application approved

== Citizen Views Status ==
Citizen -> App: View my applications
App -> AppService: getMyApplications()
AppService -> API: GET /api/applications/my-applications
API -> Backend: Request
Backend -> AppCtrl: getMyApplications()
AppCtrl -> DB: SELECT applications\nWHERE citizen_id = ?
DB --> AppCtrl: Applications
AppCtrl --> Backend: JSON
Backend --> API: Response
API --> AppService: List<ApplicationModel>
AppService --> App: Applications
App --> Citizen: Show status: "Approved"

== Certificate Download ==
Citizen -> App: Download certificate
App -> App: Generate PDF certificate
App -> CertificateService: generateCertificate(application)
CertificateService -> CertificateService: Create PDF with template
CertificateService --> App: PDF file
App --> Citizen: Download/View certificate

@enduml
